{
  "description": "tikajs-f301: a PDF cut off inside its xref stream, with the catalog and the page tree only in a Flate object stream. Nothing in the file's top-level objects names a catalog, so the rebuild reads the object stream's members as objects (step objstm-inlined) and the text of the page is read.",
  "tags": [
    "repro",
    "pdf",
    "repair"
  ],
  "input": {
    "base64": "",
    "filename": "pdf-repair-cut-object-stream.pdf"
  },
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "Hello cut object stream"
    },
    {
      "type": "equals",
      "field": "metadata.tk:pdf:repaired",
      "value": "true"
    }
  ]
}
